	(text "Some extra notch filters are recommended as well.\n\nFor 80 meters one is not needed becasue the BPF has\na very good suppression of potentially problematic\nfrequencies (21.5 MHz, 28.5 MHz)\n\nFor 20-10 meters the RX LPF will do the trick."
